1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,580
A gum specialist

2
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,840
quoted me $11,500.

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,060
His own assistant

4
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:04,920
told me not

5
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:05,960
to do it.

6
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:06,540
My dentist sent

7
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:06,940
me to him

8
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,780
for gum disease.

9
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:08,590
He wanted

10
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:09,700
three gum grafts,

11
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,360
$3,000 each.

12
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,440
Plus a $2,500 procedure

13
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,460
under my tongue.

14
00:00:14,883 --> 00:00:15,423
When he stepped out,

15
00:00:15,423 --> 00:00:16,963
his assistant leaned in.

16
00:00:16,963 --> 00:00:17,583
She said she'd just

17
00:00:17,583 --> 00:00:18,463
get a deep cleaning.

18
00:00:18,994 --> 00:00:19,434
I left to think

19
00:00:19,434 --> 00:00:20,114
about it.

20
00:00:20,114 --> 00:00:21,154
A review request showed

21
00:00:21,154 --> 00:00:21,994
up right away.

22
00:00:22,422 --> 00:00:23,162
A second specialist

23
00:00:23,162 --> 00:00:24,022
fixed the problem

24
00:00:24,022 --> 00:00:25,422
for $450.

25
00:00:26,322 --> 00:00:28,182
Insurance covered $300.

26
00:00:28,182 --> 00:00:28,882
The first office kept

27
00:00:28,882 --> 00:00:30,382
asking for that review.

28
00:00:30,382 --> 00:00:31,082
So I wrote one.

29
00:00:31,082 --> 00:00:32,222
On several sites.

30
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:33,290
My dentist stopped

31
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:34,849
sending patients there.

32
00:00:34,849 --> 00:00:35,099
Later,

33
00:00:35,099 --> 00:00:35,929
that office closed.

34
00:00:35,929 --> 00:00:36,849
I can't say why.

